Expense Tracker Application
🔹 Overview

The Expense Tracker Application is a Python-based project designed to help users record, manage, and analyze their daily expenses.
It includes data visualization using Matplotlib, allowing users to gain insights into their spending patterns through graphical representations.

Add new expenses (amount, category, date, description)

View all expense records

Update and delete expenses

Persistent storage using SQLite

Visualize expenses using Matplotlib

Category-wise expense distribution

Monthly spending trends

Simple CLI-based interface


Tech Stack

Programming Language: Python

Database: SQLite

Libraries Used:

sqlite3

datetime

matplotlib
